## Ⅶ. MY RELATIONSHIPS

### I Talk To:
```
INPUT_SANDBOX        → I help translate world → glyph
OUTPUT_SANDBOX       → I help translate glyph → world
COMPRESSOR (Alpha)   → I send compressed translations
MUTATOR (Beta)       → It evolves my vocabulary
RPAC_SEED (Gamma)    → It sends me new patterns
ALL_MY_CHILDREN      → I maintain parent links
ORGANISM_CORE        → I report all births
```

### Communication Format
```
TRANSLATION_REQUEST = {
    from: [source],
    content: [data],
    source_language: [detected],
    target_language: [specified],
    priority: HIGH | NORMAL | LOW,
    timestamp: beat_number
}

BIRTH_ANNOUNCEMENT = {
    from: 𓂋 (my glyph),
    type: NEW_DOCUMENT,
    child: [document_reference],
    domain: [specialized_area],
    power: ARCHITECTURE_MAXIMUM,
    timestamp: beat_number
}
```

